{
  "description": "Names (not values) of the per-request metrics, their labels, and the audit entry fields the legacy S3 path emits, each with the RustFS file:line that emits it and the owner that supplies it once rustfs/gateway answers the request. Extracted from code, not from a running server. `literal` must appear on the cited line; tests/observability_contract.rs checks it.",
  "owners": {
    "gateway-observer": "crates/gateway-adapter/src/observer.rs, from the gateway's RequestEvent (operation, method, status) before the first body byte",
