    "outer-layer": "RustFS's own tower layers around the gateway service (rustfs/src/server/http.rs, rustfs/src/server/layer.rs): duration, bytes, cancellation, peer and request-line facts",
    "handler": "RustFS handler code the gateway dispatches to (OperationHelper and the record_s3_op call sites), unchanged by the gateway",
    "binary-sink": "the rustfs binary's implementation of this crate's sink traits: facts neither gateway hook carries, filled while turning a record into an AuditEntry"
